<!--
  `F-185` — what the bubble's own glyph becomes while the fan is open.

  The slash rotating into a cross is the whole affordance: the thing you
  pressed to open this is the thing that closes it, and it says so by changing
  shape rather than by moving. Messenger, every FAB menu and Android's own
  share sheet all do this, so it needs no explanation.
-->
